title: "Smart Traffic Light Control Using Reinforcement Learning"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-11
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An educational Python simulation of a four-way intersection in which a tabular Q-Learning agent learns to control the
  traffic light and is compared, on identical seeded traffic, with a default and a tuned fixed-time controller.
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - Q-Learning
  - traffic light control
  - simulation
